<!--
  German. Same house style as the default locale where German orthography allows it: lowercase
  throughout, including sentence starts. German nouns are capitalised regardless, because that is
  correct orthography, not a style choice — see CLAUDE.md's translation notes.

  `app_name` is deliberately absent — the launcher label is a name, not a word, and does not
  translate. So is `value_none`, which is an em dash.
-->
